From: sjcsf <346224915+llsf2020@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/19] FreeChat: show the auto-delete duration in the timeline

The SDK drops the content of custom state events from timeline items, so the
TTL of a com.freechat.disappearing change is read from the event's original
JSON: "Alice set messages to auto-delete after 1 day.", "... turned off
auto-delete." Without the JSON the notice stays generic.
